# 1. EKS Certification Landscape

There is no single "EKS certification", but EKS knowledge is tested in multiple certifications:

## AWS Certifications

Relevant:

* AWS Certified Solutions Architect
* AWS Certified DevOps Engineer

Topics include:

* EKS architecture
* Networking
* Security
* IAM
* Load balancing
* Storage
* Monitoring

---

## Kubernetes Certifications

Relevant:

* Certified Kubernetes Administrator (CKA)
* Certified Kubernetes Application Developer (CKAD)

Topics include:

* Kubernetes administration
* Workloads
* Networking
* Storage
* Troubleshooting

